Package: policycraft
Title: Longitudinal Evidence Tools for Policy Analysis
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Dan", "Swart", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "danswartcpa@gmail.com")
Description: Tools for policy analysts who examine longitudinal system data in
    temporal order, distinguish routine variation from non-random patterns,
    and translate disciplined observation and reasoning into decision-useful
    insight. Includes an interactive Shiny application with run, line, bar,
    cohort, autocorrelation, and trended and untrended expectation charts.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://danswart.github.io/policycraft/, https://github.com/danswart/policycraft
BugReports: https://github.com/danswart/policycraft/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    bslib,
    dplyr,
    DT,
    ggplot2,
    ggtext,
    lubridate,
    purrr,
    readr,
    readxl,
    rlang,
    scales,
    shiny,
    tibble,
    tidyr
Suggests:
    knitr,
    lintr,
    rmarkdown,
    shinytest2,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
